      "writtenOn": "2026-10-20T23:16:12Z",
      "side": 0,
      "message": "Could we add a regression test for this branch, BMC image is present but fails signature validation and there are no valid optional images? \n\nThe test should verify that Signature::verify() returns false. This would protect against accidentally accepting the image when assertions are disabled in release builds.",
      "revId": "2af71da7ad4d78a79ce69b603f3489c4c411761f",
