      "writtenOn": "2026-10-21T05:46:37Z",
      "side": 0,
      "message": "Thanks for the suggestion. Added a regression test that modifies the kernel image contents after signing, with no optional images present, and checks that Signature::verify() returns false.\n\nThe test leaves all signature files unchanged so that full-image signature verification can succeed, allowing it to exercise the final validity check. Also added a test for a missing later BMC partition while the first partition remains valid.\n\nRan all signature tests through the Meson QEMU wrapper with signature verification enabled: all 9 tests passed, including both new regression tests.",
      "parentUuid": "04bd7278_4d7043d2",
      "revId": "2af71da7ad4d78a79ce69b603f3489c4c411761f",
      "serverId": "adbd0a64-1f21-4d83-b585-671fe73cb6e4"
    },
    {
